t{d}x \\\\ \\tan{\\left(y - 1 \\right)} & =2 x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\tan{\\left(y - 1 \\right)}=2 x+C.\n$$" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671883 1080 "\\arcsin{\\left(y - 3 \\right)}=2 x+C" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671883 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671883 1083 #uuid "4681cc65-906b-5c53-8969-874b8ec69174" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671884 1080 "\\tan{\\left(y - 1 \\right)}=- 2 x+C" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671884 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671884 1083 #uuid "4d1f9dec-ea36-5760-aa71-a248fe6858cc" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671885 1080 "\\tan{\\left(y - 1 \\right)}=3 x+C" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671885 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671885 1083 #uuid "5b80337c-a8d8-5954-881a-6e30c779219c" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671886 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671884 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671886 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671885 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671886 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671890 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671886 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671902 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671886 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671909 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671886 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671886 1077 "selection" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671886 1078 #edb/ref 17592186671890 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671886 1079 #uuid "60fd060d-b7e8-5351-be92-90bb8b43d43a" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671887 1080 "\\left(y - 6\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}=\\left(x - 3\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}+C" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671887 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538