 1083 #uuid "77812baa-ca7f-51ec-8b26-1968eba43ddb" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671883 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671892 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671893 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671894 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671906 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671895 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671895 1077 "selection" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671895 1078 #edb/ref 17592186671893 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671895 1079 #uuid "7bef3a4e-4f48-5971-9dee-e2d365a8e974" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671896 1068 #edb/ref 17592186671901 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671896 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671896 1071 "Find the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{2 \\sqrt{x - 3}}{\\sqrt{y - 6}}.$" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671896 1072 #uuid "8bf38184-71b3-55e0-aae7-92ac2d3b9083" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671896 1074 "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{2 \\sqrt{x - 3}}{\\sqrt{y - 6}} \\\\ (\\sqrt{y - 6})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =2 \\sqrt{x - 3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (\\sqrt{y - 6})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (2 \\sqrt{x - 3})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (\\sqrt{y - 6})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int (2 \\sqrt{x - 3})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (\\sqrt{y - 6})\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int (2 \\sqrt{x - 3})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\frac{2 \\left(y - 6\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}}{3} & =\\frac{4 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}+K \\\\ \\left(y - 6\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}} & =2 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C=\\frac{3}{2}K.$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\left(y - 6\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}=2 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}+C.\n$$" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671897 1080 "e^{y + 4}=\\left(x - 3\\right)^{2}+C" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671897 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671897 1083 #uuid "8eb864ea-b06f-5970-b44a-e0cf169dfad2" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671898 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671876 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671898 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671878 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671898 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671888 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671898 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671889 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671898 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671891 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671898 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671898 1077 "selection" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671898 1078 #edb/ref 17592186671878 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671898 1079 #uuid "95c14b72-7237-51b9-8103-a1ca772f4105" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671899 1068 #edb/ref 17592186671895 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671899 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671899 1071 "Find the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{1 - \\left(y - 3\\right)^{2}}$ for $\\,|\\left(y-3\\right)|<1.$" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671899 1072 #uuid "98eb94b6-6c49-5a95-aced-95c12633a495" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671899 1074 "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\sqrt{1 - \\left(y - 3\\right)^{2}} \\\\ (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - \\left(y - 3\\right)^{2}}})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - \\left(y - 3\\right)^{2}}})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - \\left(y - 3\\right)^{2}}})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int (1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - \\left(y - 3\\right)^{2}}})\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int (1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\arcsin{\\left(y - 3 \\right)} & =x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\arcsin{\\left(y - 3 \\right)}=x+C.\n$$" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671900 1080 "e^{y + 4}=- 2 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{2}+C" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671900 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671900 1083 #uuid "9cf932c7-9c4b-5af3-a737-4a19ffa61c19" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671901 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671877 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671901 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671879 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671901 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671881 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671901 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671887 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671901 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671908 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671901 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671901 1077 "selection" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671901 1078 #edb/ref 17592186671881 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671901 1079 #uuid "c6c7faae-0ae2-5a40-8884-ddbd1ec282c1" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671902 1080 "\\tan{\\left(y - 1 \\right)}=- x+C" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671902 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671902 1083 #uuid "cb2c70e7-64db-5ac9-8a8a-7385d1eaa8d0" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671903 1080 "e^{y + 4}=2 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{2}+C" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671903 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671903 1083 #uuid "d7e71904-5acc-5fa1-91a1-acb20f519d18" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671904 1068 #edb/ref 17592186671907 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671904 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671904 1071 "Find the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\left(12 - 4 x\\right) e^{- y - 4}.$" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671904 1072 #uuid "e2cf29a2-5dd5-58a3-9067-e59917e63171" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671904 1074 "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\left(12 - 4 x\\right) e^{- y - 4} \\\\ (e^{y + 4})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =12 - 4 x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (e^{y + 4})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (12 - 4 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (e^{y + 4})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int (12 - 4 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (e^{y + 4})\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int (12 - 4 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ e^{y + 4} & =- 2 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\ne^{y + 4}=- 2 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{2}+C.\n$$" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671905 1068 #edb/ref 17592186671898 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671905 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671905 1071 "Find the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\left(4 x + 20\\right) e^{2 - y}.$" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671905 1072 #uuid "e414420b-974e-5702-bd35-607d710c9d38" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671905 1074 "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\left(4 x + 20\\right) e^{2 - y} \\\\ (e^{y - 2})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =4 x + 20\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (e^{y - 2})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (4 x + 20)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (e^{y - 2})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int (4 x + 20)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (e^{y - 2})\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int (4 x + 20)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ e^{y - 2} & =2 \\left(x + 5\\right)^{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\ne^{y - 2}=2 \\left(x + 5\\right)^{2}+C.\n$$" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671906 1080 "\\arcsin{\\left(y - 3 \\right)}=- x+C" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671906 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671906 1083 #uuid "edb66c36-2956-5340-9b17-714a9784e244" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671907 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671875 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671907 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671880 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671907 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671897 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671907 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671900 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671907 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671903 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671907 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671907 1077 "selection" 13194139538680 17592186045443 true] [17592186671907 